DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       iimmaaggeettooppss is a generic image to ps filter. It can be used as print fil‐
       ter in KDE.

       iimmaaggeettooppss works in two steps:

           1. the given file is converted to PNM format by analyzing the  file
              format and calling the appropriate conversion program.

           2. the file in PNM format is converted to PS format by calling ppnnmm‐‐
              ttooppss.

       The supported mime types are: jpeg, png, x-png,  bmp,  x-bmp,  gif  and
       tiff.

       iimmaaggeettooppss  supports  reading the parameters via stdin. A temporary file
       in _$_T_M_P_D_I_R (or _/_t_m_p if unset) is created then.

